OL,3,GNEWSAPedicab drivers must be licensed  
OL,4,Afrom Friday                            
OL,6,FPedicab drivers and operators in London
OL,7,Fwill need a licence from Friday,       
OL,8,Fbringing the industry under formal     
OL,9,Fregulation for the first time.         
OL,11,FDriving or operating one without a     
OL,12,FTransport for London (TfL) licence will
OL,13,Fbecome a criminal offence, and maximum 
OL,14,Ffares will also come into force.       
OL,16,FPassengers can be charged a base fare  
OL,17,Fof up to #5, plus up to #1 per minute  
OL,18,Fof journey time and up to #3 for each  
OL,19,Fadditional passenger.                  
