OL,3,GNEWSAPedicab drivers must be licensed  
OL,4,Afrom Friday                            
OL,6,FTfL said the caps had been set so      
OL,7,Fdrivers could still earn above the     
OL,8,FLondon Living Wage, and would be kept  
OL,9,Funder review.                          
